add_before(p,'\\section{研究问题与技术难点}',r'表\ref{tab:related_work_routes}按输入与监督区分候选优化、执行、触觉建模和跨域转换。本文将平台与示教约束作为数据生成条件，再研究有限统计监督如何支持完整触觉重建；各方法的验证对象随之从候选构型、执行轨迹转向输出分布和输入对应关系。',[27])
p='thesis/front/abstract.tex'
rep(p,'示教采集涉及反复操作、物体复位和设备维护。仿真便于控制初始条件、重复执行任务并记录完整状态，为扩大示教覆盖和分析接触过程提供了实验手段。','示教采集涉及反复操作、物体复位和设备维护，多指接触还增加了安全控制与操作协调难度。仿真便于控制初始条件、批量生成并重复执行任务，以及记录完整状态和接触信息，为扩大示教覆盖和分析接触过程提供了实验手段。',[7,16])
rep(p,'根据指节、指尖和手掌的几何差异构建曲面阵列，获得16个触觉区域、712维处理后观测。','根据指节、指尖和手掌的几何差异构建曲面阵列，获得16个触觉区域、712维处理后观测，五类任务各一条历史记录的触觉数组均通过维度、有限性与非负性检查。',[13])
rep(p,'适配GraspQP官方评价指标，参考DexEvolve设计实现进化搜索，通过腕部姿态扩展、可达性、碰撞约束和连续轨迹检查，将抓取候选转化为专家示教。','将GraspQP官方评价指标适配到六驱动手部代理，参考DexEvolve设计实现进化搜索，并结合腕姿格点扩展、IK可达性、碰撞约束和连续轨迹检查，将抓取候选转化为经过严格回放验证的专家示教。',[9,10])
rep(p,'Collecting demonstrations requires repeated operation, object resetting, and equipment maintenance. Simulation enables controlled initial conditions, repeatable execution, and access to complete states, supporting broader demonstration coverage and contact analysis.','Collecting demonstrations requires repeated operation, object resetting, and equipment maintenance, while multi-finger contact adds safety and coordination demands. Simulation enables controlled initial conditions, batch generation, repeatable execution, and access to complete states and contact information, supporting broader demonstration coverage and contact analysis.',[7,14])
rep(p,'provide 16 sensing patches and 712 processed channels. Official GraspQP metrics are adapted, and evolutionary search is implemented with reference to DexEvolve. Wrist-pose expansion, reachability, collision constraints, and continuous-trajectory checks connect grasp candidates to expert demonstrations.','provide 16 sensing patches and 712 processed channels. One historical record from each of five tasks passes tactile dimension, finiteness, and non-negativity checks. Official GraspQP metrics are adapted to a six-drive hand surrogate, and evolutionary search is implemented with reference to DexEvolve. Wrist-pose lattice expansion, inverse-kinematics reachability, collision constraints, and continuous-trajectory checks connect grasp candidates to strictly replay-verified expert demonstrations.',[9,13,14])
